IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. GRADES.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-CORRECT PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-TOTAL   PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-PERCENT PIC 9(1)V9(2).
    01 WS-LETTER  PIC A(1).
  
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  ACCEPT WS-CORRECT FROM CONSOLE.
  ACCEPT WS-TOTAL FROM CONSOLE.
  DIVIDE WS-CORRECT BY WS-TOTAL GIVING WS-PERCENT ROUNDED.
  DISPLAY WS-PERCENT.

EVALUATE TRUE
  WHEN WS-PERCENT >= .90
    DISPLAY 'A'
  WHEN WS-PERCENT >= .80 AND WS-PERCENT <= .89
    DISPLAY 'B'
  WHEN WS-PERCENT >= .70 AND WS-PERCENT <= .79
    DISPLAY 'C'
  WHEN WS-PERCENT >= .60 AND WS-PERCENT <= .69
    DISPLAY 'D'
  WHEN WS-PERCENT <= .59
    DISPLAY 'F'
END-EVALUATE.
